	(text "Sequence (DS930): VCCINT first; its power-good enables 1.8 V (1.2 V follows 1.8 V); the 1.8 V power-good enables 3.3 V;\nthe 3.3 V power-good enables the clock supply. Soft-start about 13 ms per rail. Each power-good is pulled up to the rail it monitors."
